      "source_text": "……嗯，没错。不过很抱歉，能晚点再来吗！\n我现在正在实验的收尾阶段──",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b318acd9289af785554d49db32a8d7711fc3483bca3a0754e29035b239b6f96",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
